<title>GERMANY: German-Dutch insurers set up D&amp;O insurance pool.</title>
<headline>German-Dutch insurers set up D&amp;O insurance pool.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven German insurers and one Dutch company have set up an underwriting pool for directors and officers (D&amp;O) risks, German insurance firm Gothaer insurance said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The pool operates as a limited company with the Name VOV-GmbH (Verwaltungsorganisation fuer Vermoegens schadenhaftpflicht-Versicherungen fuer Mitglieder von Organen juristischer Personen GmbH).</p>
</text>
